[{"title":"鹅湖春色","author":"张仁及","text":"平湖漾晴绿，狎鸥自相逐。\n归艇小于盂，轻帆晒蒲幅。\n青萍恣漂流，白鱼跳尺玉。\n柳线牵人衣，香林雨新沐。\n汀尾沙禽鸣，人家映脩竹。\n步履随春风，席地倾醽醁。\n玩乐当如何，回首炎威促。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64757,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和吴公仲庶游海云寺","author":"张湍","text":"海云真赏甲刀州，十里春光拂马头。\n花酒价高分宴乐，绮罗人好助风流。\n出郊行旆从编俗，摸石居民事胜游。\n斜日欢心犹未足，藩侯归辔为迟留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64758,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"张固","text":"鹿石晓寒云漠漠，虎溪春浅水潺潺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64759,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剑阁","author":"何亮","text":"千峰如剑列虚空，曾隔车书不混同。\n安得乾坤作炉冶，铸为农器散寰中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64760,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄远","author":"柴援","text":"别时指我堂前柳，柳色青时望子时。\n今日柳绵吹欲尽，尚凭书去说相思。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64761,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客舍","author":"柴援","text":"只影寄空馆，萧然饥鹤姿。\n秋风北窗来，问我归何时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64762,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三学院二首 其一","author":"李鼗","text":"远岫朝来更爽，孤云徙倚长闲。\n飞出偶成霖雨，归来依旧青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64763,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三学院二首 其二","author":"李鼗","text":"江横水如带，枫落山为屏。\n高深自天险，豪迈由地灵。\n行个古道中，下马坐邮亭。\n鹤栖必仙家，凤仪岂尧庭。\n神仙事恍惚，谁实观超升。\n孙氏一时杰，父兄俱有声。\n将军垂紫髯，阿瞒眼亦青。\n周郎往视师，不数李与程。\n缅怀前哲人，耿耿在心扃。\n托宿就萧寺，梦还神更清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64764,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝林院岩香阁","author":"李鼗","text":"花到清明际，随春渡虎溪。\n勾牵木芍药，流落古招提。\n独喜孤芳在，何妨众草齐。\n定知妃子意，不解谪仙题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64765,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李去病郎中出使西蜀","author":"李鼗","text":"宗盟一派落三川，人物风流类谪仙。\n自小飞声灿星斗，至今挥翰起云烟。\n过家徙倚东山外，弭节雍容锦水边。\n信道儒冠真贵重，疾驱负弩令君先。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64766,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李公鼗宝林院岩香阁","author":"释则安","text":"醉歌寒食夜，花照武陵溪。\n吟钵聊先击，诗筒更远提。\n影随春色动，芳与国香齐。\n玉节重来赏，僧窗觅旧题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64767,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨轰漈","author":"蔡佃","text":"水流石激拟鸣雷，洞里乾坤别有台。\n玉舄扶风飞复下，琼花带雨落还开。\n钟声敲断白云袅，树影盘回黄鹤来。\n笑道神仙无觅处，空留丹灶冷苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64768,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"豁然阁","author":"蔡佃","text":"长风东南来，浊浪挠清镜。\n小轩寂寞人，默视心境静。\n扁舟暂淹留，思与孤鸿迥。\n洞庭眼中物，何必更乘兴。\n顽石漫巑岏，终惭泗滨磬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64769,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟入江阴集句","author":"林震","text":"疏疏芦苇旧江天，何处风光最可怜。\n一带楼台擎晓月，万株杨柳拂晴烟。\n身闲暂觉尘埃远，道在宁忧雨露偏。\n三顷湖田秋更熟，浊醪粗饭任吾年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64770,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林震","text":"青山有恨花初谢，流水无言草自春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64771,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洗心泉","author":"胡侃","text":"岩根石溜自涓涓，一见尘劳顿洒然。\n惟有开山老尊宿，无心可洗亦无泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64772,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望海亭","author":"陈寿朋","text":"谩指亭前柏，西来意自深。\n迷人终著景，达士了忘心。\n六叶传真谛，微言振道林。\n法门应不二，来此默追寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64773,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西轩","author":"王孳","text":"步蹑霜莎入梵宫，一轩佳处属支公。\n剩开青琐延明月，疏植修篁待好风。\n笠泽波声春雨里，洞庭山色夕阳中。\n江头景物牢笼尽，欲寄琴尊此养蒙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64774,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题房城驿","author":"曾弼","text":"万山飞不出，有屈向谁伸。\n寄语弦歌宰，留心且为民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64775,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李伯纪丞相挽诗 其一","author":"曾开","text":"先帝收多士，惟公最妙年。\n清班依日月，谠论薄云天。\n终赖高名重，来扶大业全。\n谁提太史笔，臣主颂俱贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64776,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李伯纪丞相挽诗 其二","author":"曾开","text":"太上初传位，安危俛仰间。\n从容回万乘，指顾复三关。\n汉北尘沙迥，闽中日月闲。\n谁知千载后，遗恨在燕山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64777,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李伯纪丞相挽诗 其三","author":"曾开","text":"追数中兴相，公居第一人。\n初期从北伐，宁料久南巡。\n此日劳明主，他年忆旧臣。\n东都朝万国，不复见簪绅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64778,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李伯纪丞相挽诗 其四","author":"曾开","text":"昔造东都第，斯文得典型。\n谬蒙蕃下榻，亲见鲤趋庭。\n雁序相先后，鸿飞独杳冥。\n至今鸾鹄峙，梧竹养修翎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64779,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李伯纪丞相挽诗 其五","author":"曾开","text":"一别睢阳后，风霜十五年。\n劳生俱老矣，流涕独潸然。\n丹井秋来就，心灯夜半传。\n定应真不死，归卧白云边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64780,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"曾开","text":"咄哉瞎驴，丛林妖孽。\n震地一声，天机漏泄。\n有人更问意如何，拈起拂子劈口截。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64781,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"曾开","text":"翠幕管弦三市晓，画堂烟雨五峰秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64782,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢恩","author":"彭路","text":"圣主求贤轸念劳，临轩策问萃时髦。\n龙鳞日绕天颜近，螭首云移帝座高。\n疏草披丹陈紫禁，宫花锡采光蓝袍。\n自惭朽芥叨荣遇，报答能忘圣语褒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64783,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和彭路谢恩","author":"崇宁翰林","text":"一经曾守十年劳，振藻今为旷世髦。\n凤阁风云平地奋，龙门波浪捲天高。\n青钱声重鸣金赋，红杏香生茜锦袍。\n主圣臣贤当作颂，愧无椽笔继王褒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64784,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"驾幸太学","author":"李阶","text":"天祐斯文赖表章，皇心眷眷事胶庠。\n享严祖殿回龙驭，德警儒班肃鹭行。\n降辇诣祠追四圣，拥经求道举三王。\n欲知盛美前无古，贤圣相逢在庙堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64785,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题临江军驿舍二首 其一","author":"江端友","text":"李白当年谪夜旔，中原不复汉文章。\n纳官赎罪何人在，壮士悲歌泪两行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64786,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉延行","author":"江端友","text":"观文学士留都守，中常侍门如役走。\n玉延厥篚二十五，谨书名衔细看丑。\n推而上之何止此，牢耶石邪犹八九。\n嗟哉膏血出生灵，割剥乃饷无须口。\n仲华拜衮虽有年，宋璟李鄘曾愧否。\n乐全见事何其微，义勇固应如此厚。\n翰林未用汝脱靴，不知何为勤洗手。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64787,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"江端友","text":"万里江河隔，伤心九日来。\n蓬惊秋日后，菊换故园开。\n楚欲图周鼎，汤犹击夏台。\n东篱那一醉，尘爵耻虚罍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64788,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题清芬阁","author":"江端友","text":"淆名江上月，幽思岭边云。\n没世无知己，陪祠未当勤。\n丧衾论邪正，诗律较铢分。\n端似太丘长，公卿见纪群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64789,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"江端友","text":"比年荧惑犯南斗，何日燕人祭北门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64790,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"江端友","text":"仓舒止用儿童计，亦自能知尔重轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64791,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建炎丞相成国吕忠穆公退老堂 其一","author":"王绹","text":"尚父风猷袭后昆，复生贤相绍高门。\n白麻恳避公孤贵，黄阁屡辞机务繁。\n再入经纶劳鼎铉，乍从觞咏乐山樊。\n功名终始追前哲，美播青编望益尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64792,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建炎丞相成国吕忠穆公退老堂 其二","author":"王绹","text":"巨力曾扶国步安，功成犹未鬓毛斑。\n天心正佑宋无极，人意讵容公久闲。\n裴令纵能娱绿野，谢公可是老东山。\n何当鼓棹轻千里，款奉清谈宴俎闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64793,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日书怀","author":"胡安国","text":"一气本无息，春风花又开。\n景多闲后见，诗好静中来。\n午枕庄周梦，东轩靖节杯。\n不须篱畔菊，能制暮龄颓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64794,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"首夏言怀","author":"胡安国","text":"白日延清景，红芳转绿阴。\n川云长淡荡，鱼鸟自高深。\n静养中和气，闲消忿欲心。\n此情虽不语，沙界总知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64795,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重过丫头岩思先大夫 其一","author":"胡安国","text":"道旁山色古犹今，绿鬓偏惊白发侵。\n回想临岐分袂处，更谁能会此时心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64796,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重过丫头岩思先大夫 其二","author":"胡安国","text":"慈颜何在杳难承，教子生来重一经。\n谩向人间拾青紫，岂胜衣綵日趋庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64797,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄石山","author":"胡安国","text":"凤吹鸾舆向戚姬，满朝无策定倾危。\n直须致得商山老，能遣君王意自移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64798,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过凤林关","author":"胡安国","text":"马首西南二十年，每经关左重留连。\n殷勤拂石临流水，邂逅凭栏倚暮烟。\n千古物情吟不尽，四时风景画难传。\n何人可作隆中伴，待结比邻买钓船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64799,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉次朱子发稧饮碧泉","author":"胡安国","text":"不牵春草咏池塘，且对山泉共举觞。\n碧玉涌波清见底，戏鳞依荇款成行。\n杯盘草草情逾厚，淡话平平味更长。\n亦有浯溪耸天石，待镌佳颂压元郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64800,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟入荆江东赴建康","author":"胡安国","text":"长江渺渺接天浮，万古朝宗日夜流。\n洲在尚传鹦鹉赋，台高应见凤凰游。\n路经赤壁怀公瑾，水到柴桑忆仲谋。\n白日幸无云物蔽，好看澄景对高秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64801,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日","author":"胡安国","text":"竞装祓木饯馀寒，颂遂椒花上彩笺。\n览镜自惊非昔貌，举杯回喜得新年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64802,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十二月立春","author":"胡安国","text":"未临除夕气先交，玉嶂朝来见日消。\n冰自解围回木色，花能传信满梅梢。\n人家剪彩应书字，天仗迎春尽广郊。\n北望寒云魂梦断，任从飞去莫相招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64803,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹秋开","author":"胡安国","text":"秀出群芳照碧栏，世间颜色比应难。\n晓来露采光先泛，晚得云阴叶未残。\n艳质易迷人竞赏，道心无染兴终闲。\n使君认取真消息，同向樽前笑里看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64804,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪","author":"胡安国","text":"彤云无际朔风高，万窍嘘声正怒号。\n梅径有香迷皓萼，渔舟堪画压洪涛。\n樵家束桂邀行祝，村馆论钱吝薄醪。\n破腊莫嫌寒色□，会看禾黍满东皋。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64805,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"严陵钓台","author":"胡安国","text":"归隐桐江知几春，静看浮世一沤轻。\n此心有处元无着，误说持竿作钓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64806,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赤壁","author":"胡安国","text":"片语能令孙仲谋，气如山涌剑横秋。\n莫言诸葛成何事，万古忠言第一流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64807,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠云居僧明公五首 其一","author":"胡安国","text":"手握乾坤杀活机，纵横施设在临时。\n满堂兔马非龙象，大用堂堂总不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64808,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠云居僧明公五首 其二","author":"胡安国","text":"踏遍江南春寺苔，野云纵迹去还来。\n如今□□□峰顶，无法可传心似灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64809,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠云居僧明公五首 其三","author":"胡安国","text":"祝融峰似在城天，万古江山在目前。\n须信死心元不死，夜来明月又重圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64810,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠云居僧明公五首 其四","author":"胡安国","text":"明公从小便超群，佳句流传继碧云。\n问道别来诸念息，定将何法退魔军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64811,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠云居僧明公五首 其五","author":"胡安国","text":"十年音信断鸿鳞，梦想云居顶上人。\n香饭可能长自饱，也应分济百千身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64812,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹园书屋","author":"胡安国","text":"四壁无图画，推窗尽简书。\n真吾何所寄，深处乐如如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64813,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题崔白喧晴图","author":"胡安国","text":"黑头禽笑白头禽，头白多因计虑深。\n栖向柳条犹不稳，从风斜折更关心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64814,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移居碧泉","author":"胡安国","text":"买山固是为深幽，况有名泉例可求。\n短梦正须依白石，澹情好与结清流。\n庭栽疏竹客驯鹤，月满前川寺补楼。\n十里乡邻渐相识，醉歌田舍即丹邱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64815,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"胡安国","text":"爱日尚贪毛义檄，望云长绕仲宣楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64816,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离黄龙有作","author":"释惟尚","text":"大袖长拖出祖关，蛟龙战罢海涛闲。\n寄言白首参玄者，休把虚空侧点斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64817,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答张无垢居士","author":"释惟尚","text":"从来高价莫饶伊，百战场中奋两眉。\n夺角冲关群会也，丛林谁敢更相欺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64818,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈觉印禅师偈","author":"释惟尚","text":"须是南泉第一机，不知不觉蓦头锥。\n觌面若无青白眼，还如■■守空池。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64819,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"尼净智","text":"赵州舌头连天，老婆眉光覆地。\n分明勘破归来，无限平人瞌睡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64820,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋雨下偈","author":"释慧兰","text":"家家启户待婵娟，岂谓风云翳碧天。\n赖得个中消息在，团团不动照三千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64821,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古 其一 五位","author":"释慧兰","text":"正中偏拈转，虚空过那边。\n夜半金鸡生铁卵，明明谁辨暗中圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64822,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古 其二 五位","author":"释慧兰","text":"偏中正晓月，梳云华弄影。\n石人惊起梦魂消，带雪乌鸡回凤岭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64823,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古 其三 五位","author":"释慧兰","text":"正中来玉兔，团天耀九垓。\n万古碧潭无影像，红炉焰里雪华开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64824,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古 其四 五位","author":"释慧兰","text":"兼中至锦缝，金针双锁备。\n靴头线绽足知音，有耳不临流水流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64825,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古 其五 五位","author":"释慧兰","text":"兼中到眼里，双瞳齐喝道。\n少室山前铁马驹，三便吃尽无根草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64826,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释枢","text":"春将至，岁已暮。\n思量古往今来，祇是个般调度。\n凝眸昔日家风，下足旧时岐路。\n劝君休莫莽卤，眨上眉毛须荐取。\n东村王老笑呵呵，此道今人弃如土。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64827,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释楚明","text":"出门见山水，入见见佛殿。\n灵光触处通，诸人何不荐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64828,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释楚明","text":"阎浮有大宝，见少得还稀。\n若人将献我，成佛一饷时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64829,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]